WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.030
- I thought on Christmas,

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:02.740
it would be a great
opportunity to show you

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:04.340
what I think is one of the greatest

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.390
lawyer jokes of all time.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.940
And that's a Merry Christmas
card from your lawyer.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.750
Whoever wrote this is clearly an attorney

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.740
or works with attorneys.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.470
It's just absolutely perfect,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.230
to show that you're not guaranteeing

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.620
that you wish them a Christmas,

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.180
that the expectations
are set with a reasonable

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.480
Merry Christmas and/or
festive period, including,

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.580
but not limited to a happy
again, reasonable New Year.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.480
And then the best part
of all is of course,

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:30.270
that you have to spell out
12 with a number one and two,

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.450
because that's just what lawyers do.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:34.760
So congratulations to whoever wrote this.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.060
This is one of the greatest
lawyer jokes of all time

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.150
and from Legal Eagle,

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:42.150
I wish all of you a Merry
Christmas and/or festive period,

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.090
your mileage may vary.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:44.790
Please consult with your attorney.

